OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786126702
OL,3,COperation to clear mountain of illegal
OL,4,Cwaste dumped near river almost complete
OL,6,FA major clean-up operation of nearly
OL,7,F21,000 tonnes of illegal waste which
OL,8,Fwas illegally dumped in Kidlington in
OL,9,FOxfordshire has nearly been completed.
OL,11,FDrone images have revealed the
OL,12,Fdifference in the site - located
OL,13,Fbetween the A34 and the River Cherwell
OL,14,F- since work has been taking place to
OL,15,Fclear the waste which was dumped in
OL,16,F2025.
OL,18,FAt its peak, up to 30 lorry-loads of
OL,19,Fcommercial and domestic rubbish were
OL,20,Fbeing cleared every day.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
