FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786126702
OL,3,COperation to clear mountain of illegal
OL,4,Cwaste dumped near river almost complete
OL,6,FThe huge mountain of rubbish stretched
OL,7,Facross 8,000 square metres of land -
OL,8,Fan area larger than the pitch at
OL,9,FWembley Stadium.
OL,11,FThe #8m operation to clear the site
OL,12,Fbegan in April - a year after the dump
OL,13,Fwas first reported.
OL,15,FThe Environment Agency said they have
OL,16,Ffound further waste which has been
OL,17,Fburied below where the compound was
OL,18,Fpositioned - hidden by a thick layer
OL,19,Fof soil when the waste was illegally
OL,20,Fdumped.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786126702
OL,3,COperation to clear mountain of illegal
OL,4,Cwaste dumped near river almost complete
OL,6,FThe organisation is using a mechanical
OL,7,Fdigger and then finishing by hand to
OL,8,Favoid further damage to tree roots.
OL,10,FAn Environment Agency spokesperson
OL,11,Fsaid: "A Public Rights of Way Officer
OL,12,Ffrom Oxfordshire County Council has
OL,13,Fvisited the site to make
OL,14,Frecommendations for the eventual
OL,15,Freopening of the public footpath that
OL,16,Fruns through the site.
OL,18,F"National Highways will inspect their
OL,19,Fdrainage channels at the north and
OL,20,Feast boundaries.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786126702
OL,3,COperation to clear mountain of illegal
OL,4,Cwaste dumped near river almost complete
OL,6,F"They will also assist in determining
OL,7,Fappropriate tree safety works on their
OL,8,Fland, as there are trees with roots
OL,9,Fthat extend into the waste site.
OL,11,F"We aim to have removed all the
OL,12,Fremaining waste from the fields, land
OL,13,Fand habitat over the coming weeks to
OL,14,Frepair what was so badly damaged, by
OL,15,Fthese unscrupulous criminals."
OL,17,FSpeaking to ITV Meridian, Lib Dem
OL,18,FCouncillor Laura Gordon, from
OL,19,FOxfordshire County Council said:
OL,20,F"Obviously once the waste is gone,
OL,21,Fthat's great, that's the first step.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786126702
OL,3,COperation to clear mountain of illegal
OL,4,Cwaste dumped near river almost complete
OL,6,F"But we then need to think about
OL,7,Frestoring the site, and also what
OL,8,Fhappens to the land in future, because
OL,9,Fwe really need to think about
OL,10,Frestoring it in some way.
OL,12,F"This site was in a really challenging
OL,13,Flocation.
OL,15,F"It's right by the Cherwell, which
OL,16,Fflows into the Thames, it's also on a
OL,17,Fflood plain, so there was a real risk
OL,18,Fof the site flooding, and ending up
OL,19,Fwith some of the waste flowing into
OL,20,Fthe river and damaging that very
OL,21,Ffragile river ecosystem.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G5/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,384,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F383A1786126702
OL,3,COperation to clear mountain of illegal
OL,4,Cwaste dumped near river almost complete
OL,6,F"But also it's in a really strategic
OL,7,Flocation - next to the A34.
OL,9,F"So there was also things like a fire
OL,10,Frisk and various issues that meant it
OL,11,Fwas a really high priority to get it
OL,12,Fcleared up."
OL,14,FFour men have been arrested in
OL,15,Fconnection with the illegal waste
OL,16,Fsite, and have been released on bail
OL,17,Fpending further investigation.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G6/6
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
